WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:04.370
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and during my
Arrow Deathstroke video I asked you all to

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:10.120
submit questions about Isabel, Slade’s Plans
and the rest of the season.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.910
I picked 10 with one bonus question.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:18.150
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Q&amp;A videos for all my favorite things

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:24.170
like Game Of Thrones, Doctor Who and anything
else that’s worth doubling down on.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.669
Feel free to leave me suggestions for other
bonus videos for Arrow in the comments below.

00:00:27.669 --> 00:00:30.220
We’ve only got a few more episodes left
before the finale.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.539
On to questions.

00:00:31.539 --> 00:00:34.870
Let’s talk our way through the WTF fest
that was Deathstroke.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.530
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:43.960
Here we go, Question 1 - Slade Wilson Asks
There were some new images of Summer Glau

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.800
dressed in a costume like Slade’s do you
think she’s secretly Rose Wilson, or will

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.670
she just be Isabel dressed as Ravager.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:59.860
Very good question, this was actually something
really big that happened early Thursday morning.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.829
The images look legit and essentially show
her as Ravager.

00:01:01.829 --> 00:01:06.320
Based on the information we have right now
we can’t say she’s Rose, but we can call

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:07.380
her Ravager.

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.130
They might just be messing with the character
a little.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:14.580
Arrow has been pretty faithful to the comics,
like when Billy Wintergreen wore the Deathstroke

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.729
mask, they didn’t call him Deathstroke.

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:19.030
They waited and gave that to Slade Wilson.

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:23.570
So if it looks like Ravager and fights like
Ravager, it probably is Ravager.

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:28.580
But Isabel Rochev in the comics had this history
with Oliver’s Father and there’s a theory

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.620
she was that woman you see off screen in season
1, with the Red Shoes.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.590
That character was also involved in a plot
to use Queen Industries to make a super soldier

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:37.590
army.

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:43.630
So until the show presents us with more information
lets say she’s Isabel Ravager, not Rose

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:44.659
Wilson Ravager.

00:01:44.659 --> 00:01:50.659
The mystery is still what her history with
Slade is and how they started working together.

00:01:50.659 --> 00:01:55.600
Question 2 - McLovin asks Do you think that
the suicide squad, merlyn, and team arrow

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.640
will have to team up to beat team Deathstroke?

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.750
I definitely think the Suicide Squad will
be involved after that last scene with Amanda

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:05.280
Waller in the suicide squad episode.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:09.690
As for Merlyn, John Barrowman just tweeted
that he was back in Vancouver for filming.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:14.700
He didn’t confirm Arrow, but they’re filming
the finale.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.910
So it seems like he won’t be back till Episode
23.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:22.350
Merlyn is really only in it for Thea, so the
only way Merlyn would fight with them is if

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.350
it was to defend her.

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:24.350
So Slade and his army will have to put her
under the knife.

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:28.000
We know the super soldier army will be going
crazy all over the city in episode 22 Streets

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.000
of Fire.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Based on this image.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.630
So it’s possible that something could happen
to Thea that would compel Merlyn to help Oliver.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:35.710
I really want to see this happen.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:43.160
I love John Barrowman and I love it when bitter
enemies are forced to work together.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.510
It makes for amazing storytelling.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.830
Question 3 - Tim asks Do you think Roy will
have his own Dark Tinkerbell, and who could

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:50.830
it be?

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:51.830
2.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:52.830
Do you think Thea might become Artemis?

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:56.920
3 Do you think that Slade's army of Super
Soldier's will all receive super powers equal

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.020
to Slade and Roy, or will the serum give them
adverse effects like the "the Big Bang" that

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.840
created Static Shock, and open the series
with Villains with different Powers or abilities?

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.870
Lots of questions, so I’ll try to keep my
answers short.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:06.950
Roy’s Tinkerbell, would of course be an
evil Thea.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.660
Thea as Artemis I think is further off.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:14.150
I think the next big character shift we’ll
see is Laurel as Black Canary.

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:18.350
No idea if that will happen in season 3, it
all depends on whether Caity Lotz dies in

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:19.350
the finale.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:23.480
She’s listed in the credits on the wiki
for Episode 22 Streets of Fire.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.970
But we still don’t know anything about the
finale.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.310
And as for Super Soldiers.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.330
They’ll be just like Slade and Roy.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:32.370
But Mirakuru just enhances your own natural
abilities.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:36.540
So if the criminals weren’t good fighters
before, Mirakuru isn’t going to magically

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.400
turn them into ninjas.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.230
Think of them as like a super strong infantry.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:46.980
Slade will just shoot them at the city like
a shotgun.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:51.710
Question 4 - Galaxy Ronin asks Do you think
Deathstroke is getting all of his funding

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.710
from H.I.V.E.?﻿

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:58.540
Yeah, the HIVE teaser was a pretty huge deal
in that Russia episode.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:02.010
They were the ones that hired Deadshot to
kill Diggle’s brother.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:07.870
Deadshot implied that it was because Diggle’s
brother was into something shady with HIVE,

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:12.370
but I think that plot might be something that
will factor into season 3.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:17.250
Remember in one of my previous Q&amp;As I listed
potential villains for season 3.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.100
HIVE was one of them.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:24.280
In the comics Slade Wilson’s former wife
was a founding member of HIVE, there’s also

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.480
Queen Bee.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.590
But we haven’t learned anything new about
either of those characters recently.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:29.980
So HIVE is still a mystery.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:33.090
I would guess that Slade has ties to them.

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:38.691
He’s probably not running HIVE, but using
them the way Oliver uses ARGUS and the Suicide

00:04:38.691 --> 00:04:39.870
Squad.

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:43.890
Question 5 - Courageous asks Do you think
Brother Blood might be Jericho?

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:49.220
I saw a lot of comments about this, mostly
because of the Isabel Ravager teaser, implying

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:57.170
that she might secretly be Rose Wilson.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:01.660
But remember, Brother Blood’s real life
mother talked about him killing his real life

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.200
father when he was little.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.410
So I think Slade is just using Blood as a
means to an end.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.160
That final scene with them together made it
seem like Slade has been withholding a lot

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.960
of critical information from him.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:18.420
So don’t be surprised if he throws Blood
to the wolves before the end.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:23.440
Question 6 - Dragon Animations (no avatar)
asks Do you think Thea could become a villain?

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:28.540
In the real world of the show no I don’t
think so, but there’s always the possibility

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.920
that she could be Roy’s Evil Tinkerbell
like Shado is to Slade.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:36.890
I want to see Thea get to participate in the
action at some point.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:40.370
She is a big part of the story in episode
20.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:45.720
Question 7 - Funkasaurus asks For Episode
20 Seeing Red do you think its going to be

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:49.570
a Flash crossover or about Roy as he gets
mad.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.900
Initially when they announced the title I
thought they’d do a Flash crossover.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:55.120
Before the decided to do a separate pilot
for The Flash, this was going to be a backdoor

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.120
pilot.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.360
Like a total Flash episode.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:05.930
But when that changed they decided to make
episode 19 a crossover with Killer Frost and

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:11.380
Vibe and we now know that Episode is all Roy.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:15.120
He basically loses his shit and Team Arrow
has to deal with him.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:19.000
He gets super violent and Sara wants to kill
him, remember she’s the same person that

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.320
wanted to suicide bomb Slade on the Island.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:26.850
Oliver and Thea try to talk him down, but
he ends up hurting Thea and Oliver opens up

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.280
a can of whoop ass.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:33.700
No idea how that conflict will play out, but
it’s all about them dealing with Roy after

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:36.910
he starts to go really really crazy like Slade.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:43.690
Part of the conceit with Sara wanting to Kill
Roy is that she thinks he’s uncurable, she

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:47.050
thinks there’s no way to fix Mirakuru Madness.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:51.770
I think the solution to the Roy problem is
going to be very important for how they deal

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:53.850
with Slade in the finale.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:58.030
It seems like the only way to completely fix
Roy would be to counteract the effects of

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.210
the Mirakuru.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:06.401
So maybe they’ll try to find some way to
get it out of his system or some mirakuru

00:07:06.401 --> 00:07:08.290
grade anti-rage pills.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:11.730
Question 8 - Trey Splawn (no avatar) asks
Do you think that Amanda Waller is going to

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.440
use Roy as Arsenal in the Suicide Squad?

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:19.930
No, I think after they fix Roy so to speak,
he’ll continue to roll with Team Arrow.

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:24.280
Amanda Waller mostly just works with convicts
when it comes to the Suicide Squad.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.050
Like full on super-villains.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:32.730
She might get involved when they try to deal
with roid rage roy, say that three times fast.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:37.610
Question 9 - Steven KC asks How about when
Felicity told Oliver to "Go get Thea, and

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:38.840
kill Slade" line?

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:41.060
I actually think this was really important.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.690
It really defines Felicity’s relationship
with Oliver.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.450
She’s his lightning rod, flash joke rimshot.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:49.000
Oliver is supposed to be the leader, everyone
looks to him for guidance.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.750
So he has to have someone that can provide
him with some clarity.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.350
And that’s Felicity.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:57.810
So you could say that family aside, Felicity
is the most important member on team Arrow.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.199
Because she keeps Oliver from going crazy.

00:08:00.199 --> 00:08:04.790
Question 10 - Ryan asks Based on the preview
for episode 19, do you think team arrow will

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:09.230
break into Star Labs to get some type of technology
to use against Slade?﻿ (Flash new 52 power

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:10.230
generator)

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:13.161
Yes, based on the clip it looks like Sara
comes up with the plan to “borrow” something

00:08:13.161 --> 00:08:14.169
from Star Labs.

00:08:14.169 --> 00:08:18.130
And that’s how the Flash characters get
involved.

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:22.620
It’s Daniel Panabaker as Caitlin Snow and
Cisco Ramon, two researchers working at Star

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:23.620
Labs.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:29.650
In the timeline, this is all happening in
real time, so it’s been a couple months

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:33.479
since the Particle Accelerator exploded and
gave Barry Allen his powers.

00:08:33.479 --> 00:08:38.550
We don’t know if or when Snow will become
Killer Frost or Cisco will become Vibe.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.729
It would be awesome if it happens in the episode.

00:08:40.729 --> 00:08:45.380
But as quickly as the story moves, I feel
like they’re going to save that kind of

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.820
stuff for the actual Flash TV Show whenever
it comes.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.170
In the clip Cisco is firing a big weapon,
so that could be something Oliver and Sara

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:55.570
are trying to steal, but Star Labs is full
of neat super hero tech.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:09:00.560
anb one last Bonus Question - James Thomas
asks Do you think the death of a character

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.500
is what will bring team Arrow back together?﻿

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:07.121
You’re talking about Agent Coulson and the
Avengers.

00:09:07.121 --> 00:09:10.200
There have been a lot of events recently that
suggest that might happen.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:15.140
Like suicide bomber Sara, Laurel Black Canary
teases, Moira and Detective Lance talking

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:18.210
about not being able to take the pain of losing
people.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.200
Something tells me that Team Arrow will be
fixed again before the finale.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:25.080
I don’t think they’ll do a straight up
copy of what happened in Avengers, but I do

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.210
think someone will die in one of those last
two episodes.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:32.010
It just feels like the plot is building to
that kind of a moment.

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:34.540
Everyone be sure to let me know who you think
is going to die.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:39.130
And thanks so much for submitting questions,
I always love doing Q&amp;A videos.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:43.600
I’m actually working on something special
for Game of Thrones that if it works, I’ll

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.640
start doing it for other big shows like Arrow.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:52.930
Next week is a break, so I’ll be doing a
bonus Arrow video, be sure to subscribe to

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:55.630
get it and leave me suggestions for what to
talk about.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:10:01.451
In the meantime check out my top 10 wtf moments
from the episode here and click here for my

00:10:01.451 --> 00:10:02.451
Winter Soldier Review.

00:10:02.451 --> 00:10:03.910
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:04.379
High Fives!

